Structure:
- **theory `po-co-detekcja-zmian`** — motivates change-detection on SAR (all-weather, specular reflection on water → dark patch); contrasts difference vs ratio; carries inline Commons image + section-level Rignot 1993 source.
- **theory `log-ratio-derivation`** — multiplicative-noise model → log linearises it; symmetric Gaussian-like histogram → one-sided Otsu; section-level Twele 2016 source.
- **dataTable `operatory-zmian`** — difference / ratio / log-ratio / mean-ratio side-by-side.
