- **quiz `quiz-detekcja-zmian`** — calibration-bias scenario with three plausible misconception-driven distractors.
- **sandbox `mini-projekt-pipeline`** — full DLR/UN-SPIDER pipeline on a synthetic two-date scene: log-ratio → 5×5 mean smoothing → Otsu → opening/closing → small-component pruning → precision/recall/F1 against ground truth.
